WEBVTT

00:14:57.912 --> 00:15:02.121
And that's what I want to say as a quote
unquote, observer of humanity.

00:15:02.537 --> 00:15:06.746
It's what I'm trying to say to as many
students and and even professors

00:15:06.746 --> 00:15:12.746
and deans and line cooks and whoever else
I get a chance to talk to, you know,

00:15:12.746 --> 00:15:15.204
Uber drivers or whatever, although
I haven't gotten in

00:15:15.204 --> 00:15:18.371
a car other than my own in a long time,

00:15:19.121 --> 00:15:24.037
it's allow ourselves the time not to know.

00:15:24.871 --> 00:15:27.954
Yeah. Give yourself some
permission not to know.

00:15:28.371 --> 00:15:32.412
And please, if it's helpful, think of the
Zig-Zag project as your neutral zone,